# La cuenta origen debe ser del cliente (403 si no); un ADMIN puede usar cualquiera.
# La respuesta trae transactionCode y el estado: COMPLETED, DECLINED (rechazo de account-service, con
# el motivo), FAILED o PENDING (account-service no respondió; se reintenta solo).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transaction/create
@customerToken = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DE_auth.http
@accountNumber = ACC-1774713408076
@clabe = 002010113717262634
@targetAccountNumber = ACC-1847392018473
@targetClabe = 002180700148685530
# De account-service/card.http (POST /card): número y CVV de una tarjeta emitida a la cuenta
@cardNumber = 4123450000000001
@cvv = 000

### Transferencia - número de cuenta a número de cuenta
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "description": "Pago de renta febrero",
  "currency": "MX",
  "sourceIdentifier": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "sourceIdentifierType": "ACCOUNT",
  "targetIdentifier": "{{targetAccountNumber}}",
  "targetIdentifierType": "ACCOUNT"
}

### Transferencia - CLABE a CLABE
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100.00,
  "description": "Pago con CLABE",
  "currency": "MX",
  "sourceIdentifier": "{{clabe}}",
  "sourceIdentifierType": "CLABE",
  "targetIdentifier": "{{targetClabe}}",
  "targetIdentifierType": "CLABE"
}

### Transferencia - desde la cuenta de una tarjeta a una CLABE
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50.00,
  "description": "Transferencia desde la tarjeta",
  "currency": "MX",
  "sourceIdentifier": "{{cardNumber}}",
  "sourceIdentifierType": "CARD",
  "targetIdentifier": "{{targetClabe}}",
  "targetIdentifierType": "CLABE"
}

### Compra con tarjeta: se declina si la tarjeta no es de la cuenta, no está ACTIVE, venció o el CVV no coincide
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 349.99,
  "description": "Compra en tienda departamental",
  "sourceAccountNumber": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "sourceCardNumber": "{{cardNumber}}",
  "cvv": "{{cvv}}",
  "merchantCode": "MERC-001",
  "merchantCategory": "RETAIL_CLOTHING",
  "posId": "POS-00234",
  "currency": "MX"
}

### Pago de servicio (ELECTRICITY, WATER, GAS u OTHER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/service-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 875.50,
  "description": "Pago de luz marzo",
  "sourceAccountNumber": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "paymentReference": "LUZ-RPT-20240317-0100",
  "serviceType": "ELECTRICITY",
  "currency": "MX"
}

### Retiro en cajero
POST {{baseUrl}}/withdrawal
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "description": "Retiro en cajero",
  "sourceAccountNumber": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "atmLocation": "Av. Insurgentes Sur 1234, CDMX",
  "atmSessionId": "ATM-SESSION-20240118-4521",
  "receiptNumber": "RCP-20240118-0056",
  "transactionFee": 25.00,
  "currency": "MX",
  "securityVerificationMethod": "PIN",
  "withdrawalMethod": "DEBIT_CARD"
}
